WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.299
"My Rival and Me"

3
00:32.300 --> 00:34.300
(Episode 6)

4
00:34.399 --> 00:35.520
I'd be the top, though.

5
00:37.333 --> 00:39.853
No, how can I assume I've gone gay?

6
00:39.885 --> 00:40.965
Wei Yanzi, stay calm.

7
00:41.184 --> 00:43.784
I can't lose my cool at a time like this.

8
00:44.404 --> 00:46.325
Sorry to keep you waiting.

9
00:49.119 --> 00:50.119
Here.

10
00:50.560 --> 00:51.560
Have some fruit.

11
00:51.679 --> 00:52.679
Oh, thanks.

12
01:02.759 --> 01:05.799
So this is your cat?

13
01:07.560 --> 01:08.560
Wow.

14
01:08.920 --> 01:10.400
He's so cute!

15
01:10.480 --> 01:11.680
Mm. He's smart, too.

16
01:12.560 --> 01:13.159
William.

17
01:13.239 --> 01:14.239
Hey.

18
01:14.799 --> 01:15.799
Come to Daddy.

19
01:17.400 --> 01:18.400
Come here.

20
01:21.400 --> 01:24.120
What did you just call him?

21
01:24.840 --> 01:25.840
William.

22
01:29.000 --> 01:30.000
Oh.

23
01:30.359 --> 01:31.439
You've got the same name.

24
01:32.840 --> 01:35.280
So you've secretly been my daddy all this time?

25
01:36.200 --> 01:36.920
Tell me the truth.

26
01:37.200 --> 01:39.000
Do you often scold him just to get at me?

27
01:40.439 --> 01:41.560
No.

28
01:42.280 --> 01:44.799
I named him when I brought him home.

29
01:45.280 --> 01:46.280
Oh, right.

30
01:46.879 --> 01:48.120
Back then,

31
01:48.200 --> 01:49.519
when you sprained your ankle,

32
01:49.959 --> 01:50.959
I thought I'd

33
01:51.519 --> 01:52.519
give him a cameo.

34
01:54.480 --> 01:55.799
That's why I said

35
01:57.159 --> 01:59.640
you wouldn't get what that video meant.

36
02:00.799 --> 02:01.959
You didn't know his name.

37
02:03.805 --> 02:05.883
Oh, Gu Yiliang.

38
02:05.907 --> 02:07.506
He knew exactly what he was doing.

39
02:07.507 --> 02:09.107
A riot of blossoms dazzles the eyes.

40
02:09.108 --> 02:11.026
One look at Yiliang and my knees give way.

41
02:11.027 --> 02:12.067
Buddha help me, Yiliang.

42
02:12.068 --> 02:13.907
Let me say this once and for all.

43
02:13.908 --> 02:15.907
I, Wei Yanzi, am straight as an arrow.

44
02:16.054 --> 02:18.453
Think you can bend me? Bring it on.

45
02:21.199 --> 02:22.039
Don't move.

46
02:22.159 --> 02:23.159
Hold that pose.

47
02:23.400 --> 02:23.960
William.

48
02:24.319 --> 02:25.319
Open your eyes wide.

49
02:34.560 --> 02:36.120
Hey, William! William!

50
02:36.400 --> 02:37.400
Let him go play.

51
02:40.400 --> 02:41.959
This is so cozy.

52
02:41.960 --> 02:44.839
Wei Yanzi, you've got someone now.

53
02:45.166 --> 02:46.519
Someone to lean on. [Someone to top]

54
02:46.520 --> 02:47.718
The “Yi” [Top] in Gu Yiliang.

55
02:47.719 --> 02:49.912
How come he gets to be the top?

56
02:49.936 --> 02:51.515
No way. Bring it on.

57
03:02.800 --> 03:05.759
My two Williams.

58
03:09.000 --> 03:11.240
I'm so done for.

59
03:17.680 --> 03:20.360
I'm going to the bathroom.

60
03:40.840 --> 03:41.840
Douya.

61
03:42.159 --> 03:43.159
What do I do?

62
03:44.199 --> 03:46.159
My rival just gave me

63
03:47.000 --> 03:48.960
a seriously horny look.

64
03:50.759 --> 03:52.120
Was that a hint?

65
03:55.400 --> 03:56.759
Are we really going to...

66
03:57.520 --> 03:58.080
do it?

67
03:58.280 --> 04:00.638
Your query violates public decency

68
04:00.639 --> 04:02.438
and carries significant risks.

69
04:02.439 --> 04:03.879
Please stop immediately.

70
04:05.159 --> 04:06.639
What good are you?

71
04:08.439 --> 04:09.439
Ugh.

72
04:09.919 --> 04:12.360
Maybe I shouldn't have walked out like that.

73
04:13.879 --> 04:16.000
Does he think I can't handle it?

74
04:22.360 --> 04:25.360
I just didn't think we'd move this fast.

75
04:26.160 --> 04:28.199
I haven't even lined up any roles for him.

76
04:30.480 --> 04:31.480
Gu Yiliang.

77
04:31.600 --> 04:31.959
Yeah?

78
04:32.040 --> 04:33.199
What are you doing?

79
04:33.439 --> 04:36.839
I just petted William.

80
04:37.120 --> 04:38.199
I'm washing my hands.

81
04:38.720 --> 04:40.560
I'm about to open a can for him.

82
04:40.680 --> 04:41.720
Dirty hands

83
04:42.079 --> 04:43.079
make him throw up.

84
04:43.279 --> 04:45.399
What a pampered cat.

85
04:56.519 --> 04:57.720
My rival's rushing me.

86
04:57.879 --> 04:59.680
He really does think I can't handle it.

87
05:00.385 --> 05:01.385
What do I do?

88
05:01.672 --> 05:02.672
Fine.

89
05:02.879 --> 05:04.678
If he's really that impatient,

90
05:05.426 --> 05:07.306
I'll go along with it for now.

91
05:07.879 --> 05:10.439
I'll get him those roles later.

92
05:11.319 --> 05:13.560
Does it take that long to wash your hands?

93
05:14.199 --> 05:16.839
Why is it so quiet in there?

94
05:17.319 --> 05:18.319
Gu Yiliang.

95
05:18.721 --> 05:19.800
Are you sick?

96
05:19.959 --> 05:21.136
Don't put off seeing a doctor.

97
05:21.160 --> 05:22.279
If you're sick, get help.

98
05:22.800 --> 05:23.800
Gu Yiliang.

99
05:23.839 --> 05:24.839
Gu Yiliang. Gu...

100
05:32.133 --> 05:33.113
S-Stop looking.

101
05:33.260 --> 05:34.660
I was kidding about the challenge.

102
05:35.199 --> 05:35.800
My knees are jelly.

103
05:36.259 --> 05:38.019
You win. I'm jelly, okay?

104
05:43.319 --> 05:44.319
Let's...

105
05:46.439 --> 05:48.759
L-Let's what?

106
05:49.160 --> 05:51.439
Get a room? Get it on? Roll camera? Start?

107
05:51.759 --> 05:52.240
Let's...

108
05:52.759 --> 05:53.879
Let's...

109
05:54.600 --> 05:55.600
Let's team up online.

110
06:17.120 --> 06:18.480
Will you let me go?

111
06:19.279 --> 06:21.160
I feel awful. I quit.

112
06:21.800 --> 06:22.800
I quit!

113
06:25.720 --> 06:26.800
Cheng, you dog.

114
06:28.759 --> 06:29.959
You're a monster.

115
06:30.240 --> 06:31.600
I'm already suffering here.

116
06:33.160 --> 06:34.160
I'm quitting.

117
06:34.480 --> 06:35.959
A capitalist is trying to kill me!

118
06:36.360 --> 06:37.879
Quitting isn't an option.

119
06:39.120 --> 06:40.480
Didn't you read your contract?

120
06:41.600 --> 06:42.319
Cheng, you dog.

121
06:42.600 --> 06:43.600
You're a monster.

122
06:45.399 --> 06:46.639
Feeling better, I see.

123
06:46.920 --> 06:47.920
Come on.

124
06:49.153 --> 06:50.600
- Come on. - Let go of me.

125
07:03.680 --> 07:04.279
Your fever's gone.

126
07:04.399 --> 07:05.560
How do you feel now?

127
07:06.399 --> 07:07.959
Just weak all over.

128
07:08.199 --> 07:09.319
Nothing else feels wrong.

129
07:09.800 --> 07:11.279
You had severe heatstroke.

130
07:11.399 --> 07:13.896
Good thing your friend cooled you down and got you hydrated in time.

131
07:13.920 --> 07:15.079
When he brought you in,

132
07:15.160 --> 07:16.439
you threw up all over him.

133
07:16.920 --> 07:19.360
He got you cleaned up and on an IV before he showered.

134
07:22.040 --> 07:23.079
Get some rest.

135
07:23.120 --> 07:24.120
Drink plenty of water.

136
07:27.720 --> 07:29.199
The doctor said to get electrolytes.

137
07:41.360 --> 07:42.759
Can't you take credit for once?

138
07:42.920 --> 07:44.240
You make good news sound tragic.

139
07:51.240 --> 07:52.240
Glad you're okay.

140
08:01.920 --> 08:03.839
I'm perfectly calm.

141
08:03.920 --> 08:06.480
I could almost laugh. Yeah, right.

142
08:06.505 --> 08:08.720
Seriously, how is that fair?

143
08:08.879 --> 08:12.240
Gu Yiliang, you swept me off my very straight feet.

144
08:12.480 --> 08:14.279
Then you slapped me straight again.

145
08:14.303 --> 08:17.022
Flirting and running should be a crime.

146
08:17.785 --> 08:20.866
No. I need an explanation.

147
08:21.839 --> 08:22.439
Have a seat.

148
08:22.600 --> 08:23.600
Oh.

149
08:26.319 --> 08:26.800
Huh?

150
08:27.160 --> 08:28.240
We're not playing Dota?

151
08:28.839 --> 08:29.839
Let's play League.

152
08:30.240 --> 08:31.720
I want to play what you like.

153
08:32.200 --> 08:32.879
Don't worry.

154
08:33.039 --> 08:34.039
I've played before.

155
08:34.720 --> 08:36.720
I'm just not very good.

156
08:37.240 --> 08:38.840
Okay. Dota next time, then.

157
08:39.240 --> 08:40.240
Mm.

158
08:41.639 --> 08:43.200
“I want to play what you like.”

159
08:43.545 --> 08:45.065
Would Guan Yu say that to Zhang Fei?

160
08:45.919 --> 08:47.760
Is he actually straight?

161
08:47.865 --> 08:50.465
Did I get the wrong idea earlier?

162
08:53.840 --> 08:54.840
So...

163
08:56.080 --> 08:57.080
If...

164
08:57.240 --> 08:58.960
I mean, hypothetically,

165
09:00.360 --> 09:02.480
if you had the chance,

166
09:03.919 --> 09:07.320
and I wanted us to

167
09:07.720 --> 09:08.960
climb the ranks together

168
09:09.639 --> 09:11.399
and build a brighter future,

169
09:12.919 --> 09:14.039
what would you say?

170
09:18.480 --> 09:19.759
You want to duo in ranked?

171
09:21.519 --> 09:22.519
Then I'll play Kha'Zix.

172
09:23.000 --> 09:24.039
I crush it on Kha'Zix.

173
09:24.480 --> 09:25.840
You trust me that much?

174
09:26.120 --> 09:27.440
You asked me to play ranked!

175
09:28.240 --> 09:29.240
So, if...

176
09:29.480 --> 09:30.519
if I play badly,

177
09:31.000 --> 09:32.120
you won't yell, right?

178
09:34.519 --> 09:37.000
Of course not. I'm a chill gamer.

179
09:39.679 --> 09:40.679
Log in.

180
09:41.080 --> 09:43.278
Gu Yiliang, get in this teamfight!

181
09:43.279 --> 09:46.839
What are you doing in the jungle? Sightseeing? Shopping for souvenirs?

182
09:46.840 --> 09:48.360
Gu Yiliang!

183
09:48.480 --> 09:50.600
Could you at least use your passive?

184
09:50.679 --> 09:54.199
Move that precious finger and press R. R! R!

185
09:54.593 --> 09:55.999
Gu Yiliang, saving your ult for next year?

186
09:56.000 --> 09:58.079
Are your fingers tied in knots?

187
09:58.080 --> 09:59.959
Forward! Keep going!

188
09:59.960 --> 10:02.159
Behind you! They're behind you!

189
10:02.519 --> 10:03.679
Gu Yiliang!

190
10:03.840 --> 10:06.320
Where are you going? You taking on ten guys alone?

191
10:06.679 --> 10:09.159
Get your ass back here!

192
10:10.679 --> 10:12.440
Gu Yiliang!

193
10:18.279 --> 10:19.279
A chill gamer?

194
10:20.279 --> 10:21.600
A full-on warrior Buddha.

195
10:24.159 --> 10:26.399
I'll get you a fresh one.

196
10:27.000 --> 10:28.000
Oh.

197
10:36.240 --> 10:37.240
Was I...

198
10:38.240 --> 10:39.960
a little too harsh just now?

199
10:40.799 --> 10:43.080
I just can't figure Gu Yiliang out.

200
10:43.759 --> 10:46.360
Sometimes he's devious as hell.

201
10:46.559 --> 10:48.159
Other times he's got one brain cell.

202
10:49.639 --> 10:50.639
No.

203
10:50.879 --> 10:51.879
I have to stay strong.

204
10:52.200 --> 10:53.720
Let him flirt all he wants.

205
10:53.840 --> 10:55.559
I'll stay straight as steel.

206
11:17.559 --> 11:18.440
It's late.

207
11:18.519 --> 11:19.360
No more Coke.

208
11:19.440 --> 11:20.440
Have some water.

209
11:20.559 --> 11:21.559
Thanks.

210
11:22.240 --> 11:22.879
Oh, right.

211
11:23.080 --> 11:24.200
Where do I sleep tonight?

212
11:24.519 --> 11:25.519
With me.

213
11:33.399 --> 11:34.559
Was that something tasty?

214
11:36.480 --> 11:37.559
Can I have one?

215
11:45.559 --> 11:47.440
Here's the situation.

216
11:47.585 --> 11:49.585
Gu Yiliang has three bedrooms.

217
11:49.826 --> 11:52.585
And yet he asked me to share his.

218
11:53.240 --> 11:54.320
What does that mean?

219
11:54.600 --> 11:56.360
A test of your resolve.

220
12:00.320 --> 12:02.080
If this were fanfic,

221
12:02.632 --> 12:05.073
he'd walk out of the bathroom any second.

222
12:23.320 --> 12:24.320
No.

223
12:24.600 --> 12:25.799
I almost fell for it.

224
12:26.320 --> 12:27.320
I'll make the first move.

225
12:29.600 --> 12:30.960
So we're seeing who flirts harder?

226
12:31.120 --> 12:34.399
I'll make bigger waves than Lake Honghu.

227
12:34.519 --> 12:38.480
♪ Making waves, wild and free ♪

228
12:41.440 --> 12:42.440
Where's my phone?

229
12:43.240 --> 12:44.320
Phone.

230
12:52.919 --> 12:55.840
The one pose

231
12:56.200 --> 12:57.679
no straight guy can resist.

232
12:58.840 --> 12:59.879
The W-sit.

233
13:03.279 --> 13:04.279
No time.

234
13:04.440 --> 13:05.440
I choose you,

235
13:05.519 --> 13:06.519
Pikachu!

236
13:17.039 --> 13:18.039
Mm.

237
13:21.000 --> 13:22.000
What's going on?

238
13:23.360 --> 13:24.840
No, he's about to come out.

239
13:40.559 --> 13:41.600
What's the problem?

240
13:41.960 --> 13:43.320
Let's check your blood pressure.

241
13:45.399 --> 13:47.080
I pulled a muscle in my butt.

242
13:47.399 --> 13:47.919
What?

243
13:47.960 --> 13:48.919
His butt hurts.

244
13:48.960 --> 13:49.600
Oh.

245
13:49.919 --> 13:51.879
We don't have a proctologist in the ER.

246
13:52.559 --> 13:53.720
I strained my butt.

247
13:54.000 --> 13:55.000
Strained it.

248
13:57.399 --> 13:58.480
The bones look fine.

249
13:58.879 --> 14:00.440
It's a strained glute.

250
14:00.679 --> 14:02.480
Did you do anything strenuous recently?

251
14:05.759 --> 14:07.159
I sat in a W.

252
14:10.600 --> 14:12.320
I'll prescribe a cream.

253
14:12.519 --> 14:14.480
Apply it to the sore area three times a day.

254
14:17.559 --> 14:18.200
Go pick it up.

255
14:18.279 --> 14:19.480
Thanks, doctor.

256
14:24.000 --> 14:25.360
Take it easy, you two.

257
14:26.000 --> 14:27.080
Couples can experiment,

258
14:27.200 --> 14:28.759
but go easy on the positions.

259
14:29.000 --> 14:30.200
Don't push the body's limits.

260
14:30.759 --> 14:31.159
Okay.

261
14:31.200 --> 14:32.200
Ah.

262
14:33.246 --> 14:36.472
So this is what it's like to have the whole world against you.

263
14:36.633 --> 14:39.772
Whatever doesn't kill me keeps trying.

264
14:54.320 --> 14:55.480
Are you laughing at me?

265
14:56.240 --> 14:57.240
No.

266
15:03.240 --> 15:03.840
Are you really not?

267
15:04.000 --> 15:05.000
I'm not.

268
15:07.159 --> 15:08.480
Good thing it wasn't serious.

269
15:08.679 --> 15:09.679
Let's go home.

270
15:12.399 --> 15:14.320
That was so embarrassing.

271
15:14.840 --> 15:16.519
Am I going to trend tomorrow?

272
15:16.840 --> 15:17.840
No.

273
15:18.080 --> 15:19.519
It's a private hospital.

274
15:19.720 --> 15:20.960
Mr. Cheng recommended it.

275
15:21.080 --> 15:22.159
They're discreet here.

276
15:22.240 --> 15:23.840
No one will find out.

277
15:24.185 --> 15:24.905
Good.

278
15:25.139 --> 15:26.139
Good.

279
15:35.600 --> 15:37.240
Mingming has heatstroke?

280
15:37.320 --> 15:39.159
Why is Mr. Cheng looking after him?

281
15:40.113 --> 15:42.753
He's not even signed to Hengtu.

282
15:43.353 --> 15:46.925
What's going on with those two?

283
15:50.814 --> 15:53.255
Gu Yiliang looks so sweet and restrained.

284
15:53.279 --> 15:55.639
Behind closed doors, he put the guy in the hospital.

285
15:55.720 --> 15:58.120
Wei Yanzi has fight scenes to shoot.

286
15:58.320 --> 15:59.760
Now he can barely walk.

287
16:00.165 --> 16:03.360
I guess all sugar daddies are dogs.

288
16:06.919 --> 16:09.032
I'm pretty sure this hospital has proctology.

289
16:11.840 --> 16:12.840
Come outside with me.

290
16:15.519 --> 16:16.519
Give me a second.

291
16:27.919 --> 16:29.279
No thanks. I quit.

292
16:40.840 --> 16:42.039
You and Wei Yanzi.

293
16:42.480 --> 16:43.600
What's going on?

294
16:46.720 --> 16:48.200
I chickened out at the last second.

295
16:51.006 --> 16:52.006
It was my fault.

296
16:52.399 --> 16:54.080
I wasn't ready.

297
16:54.600 --> 16:56.840
I wanted to buy a ticket before getting on the train.

298
16:57.840 --> 16:58.600
But...

299
16:58.639 --> 17:00.000
he was in a hurry.

300
17:00.879 --> 17:02.720
He didn't give me a chance to buy one.

301
17:03.639 --> 17:05.720
I haven't even gotten him any roles.

302
17:07.759 --> 17:08.599
He doesn't need them.

303
17:08.600 --> 17:09.680
That's okay, though.

304
17:10.519 --> 17:13.079
I've figured out what works for us.

305
17:15.079 --> 17:16.599
I used to worry

306
17:16.759 --> 17:18.160
that I was too boring.

307
17:19.960 --> 17:22.839
So I followed the plot of those novels.

308
17:23.119 --> 17:24.480
But Wei Yanzi told me

309
17:24.559 --> 17:26.400
I'm fine the way I am.

310
17:27.213 --> 17:32.382
So the two of us don't have to play sugar daddy and kept boy.

311
17:33.706 --> 17:38.066
I also don't want our relationship to be purely transactional.

312
17:46.400 --> 17:47.400
Is that so?

313
17:47.880 --> 17:48.880
That's good.

314
17:51.983 --> 17:53.736
Three years earlier.

315
17:58.279 --> 18:00.200
Come on, let's drink. Cheers!

316
18:00.319 --> 18:02.279
- Have fun tonight! - Yan!

317
18:03.319 --> 18:04.880
I'll have a drink with you.

318
18:06.799 --> 18:08.079
Want a big brother that bad?

319
18:08.319 --> 18:09.640
Ask your mom to have one.

320
18:10.319 --> 18:11.319
Get lost.

321
18:11.720 --> 18:13.119
He's heartbroken. Let him be.

322
18:15.592 --> 18:16.592
Oh, come on.

323
18:16.680 --> 18:18.079
Young Master Cheng.

324
18:18.279 --> 18:19.279
Look at you.

325
18:19.319 --> 18:22.200
I brought you out to see all this grass.

326
18:22.400 --> 18:25.440
See? The grass is green everywhere.

327
18:25.839 --> 18:29.720
Forget about those little pigs and fish.

328
18:30.160 --> 18:31.160
You can get lost, too.

329
18:33.880 --> 18:35.039
If you ask me,

330
18:35.160 --> 18:36.400
this is partly on you.

331
18:36.640 --> 18:38.359
Keeping a boy is like fishing.

332
18:38.440 --> 18:40.400
A little bait just gets them interested.

333
18:40.519 --> 18:41.160
But you?

334
18:41.359 --> 18:42.880
You fed him all the good stuff.

335
18:43.400 --> 18:44.880
Once a fish has had its fill,

336
18:44.920 --> 18:46.640
of course it swims away.

337
18:46.839 --> 18:47.839
Right?

338
18:51.079 --> 18:52.079
You're right.

339
18:52.720 --> 18:53.920
I was too good to him.

340
18:54.720 --> 18:56.119
Exactly.

341
18:56.200 --> 18:57.319
Come on. Drink up.

342
18:58.119 --> 18:58.960
Well? Go on.

343
18:59.119 --> 19:00.279
Drink with Mr. Cheng.

344
19:09.960 --> 19:11.880
Thanks for bringing me that towel earlier.

345
19:12.480 --> 19:14.359
No problem. We're on the same crew.

346
19:14.599 --> 19:16.160
We should look out for each other.

347
19:24.839 --> 19:25.960
Just be careful.

348
19:26.079 --> 19:27.359
Don't push yourself too hard.

349
19:27.720 --> 19:29.599
You want to be able to keep doing it.

350
19:29.720 --> 19:30.839
If it hurts, stop.

351
19:30.960 --> 19:32.519
They won't feel sorry for you.

352
19:35.519 --> 19:36.920
So you've “sat” like that, too?

353
19:37.599 --> 19:39.159
Oh man, it hurts like hell.

354
19:39.160 --> 19:40.160
Right?

355
19:40.759 --> 19:43.799
Turns out men's and women's bodies work differently.

356
19:44.640 --> 19:46.440
I'm never trying random positions again.

357
19:47.240 --> 19:49.506
Even a star like Wei Yanzi

358
19:49.893 --> 19:52.573
has to study positions to please his sugar daddy.

359
19:56.559 --> 19:57.880
Mingming, quick question.

360
19:58.279 --> 19:59.839
What are you and Mr. Cheng?

361
19:59.920 --> 20:01.278
Did you know him already?

362
20:01.279 --> 20:02.799
Why'd he bring you to the hospital?

363
20:03.680 --> 20:05.000
What do you think?

364
20:05.599 --> 20:06.960
Whatever you and Gu Yiliang are,

365
20:07.720 --> 20:09.000
that's what we are.

366
20:10.079 --> 20:11.279
Oh, you too...

367
20:11.799 --> 20:14.480
Wow, it really is easy to turn gay.

368
20:17.640 --> 20:18.640
Mingming,

369
20:18.680 --> 20:19.680
I admire you.

370
20:20.440 --> 20:22.000
Someone like Mr. Cheng

371
20:22.119 --> 20:23.759
looks at people like he's saying,

372
20:24.000 --> 20:25.119
“This isn't personal,

373
20:25.240 --> 20:27.440
but everyone in this room is trash.”

374
20:27.938 --> 20:30.538
If you won him over, that's true love.

375
20:30.839 --> 20:32.359
No. Don't talk nonsense.

376
20:32.519 --> 20:33.519
Huh?

377
20:36.240 --> 20:37.240
Take my advice.

378
20:37.640 --> 20:38.759
For people like us,

379
20:38.799 --> 20:40.599
you can't afford to catch feelings.

380
20:40.640 --> 20:41.960
Don't take it seriously.

381
20:42.400 --> 20:44.400
If you get hurt, you'll have nowhere to turn.

382
20:44.896 --> 20:50.255
Heartbreak hurts whether you're straight or gay, doesn't it?

383
20:50.480 --> 20:51.480
Oh.

384
20:58.960 --> 20:59.960
Hey.

385
21:00.319 --> 21:01.319
Listen to this.

386
21:02.279 --> 21:03.119
Actually,

387
21:03.200 --> 21:05.599
Mingming is the boss's husband.

388
21:05.640 --> 21:06.759
The boss's husband?

389
21:06.839 --> 21:08.680
Yeah, the boss's husband.

390
21:09.599 --> 21:10.599
Oh.

391
21:11.960 --> 21:13.119
Why aren't you surprised?

392
21:14.039 --> 21:15.160
You already knew?

393
21:16.160 --> 21:18.240
When I joined Hengtu three years ago,

394
21:19.119 --> 21:20.920
I heard Mr. Zhu was going to sign with us.

395
21:21.279 --> 21:24.160
He'd just got a Jinlan nomination for Best Supporting Actor.

396
21:25.359 --> 21:27.720
But for some reason, he never signed.

397
21:28.960 --> 21:31.000
Once I got to know Mr. Cheng,

398
21:31.519 --> 21:33.759
I found out his family wasn't in showbiz.

399
21:33.800 --> 21:37.239
He started Hengtu for Mr. Zhu.

400
21:37.480 --> 21:38.480
Oh.

401
21:40.480 --> 21:43.000
So Mr. Cheng is the real domineering CEO.

402
21:43.200 --> 21:45.160
He's pretty bad at being one, though.

403
21:45.599 --> 21:47.480
Mingming doesn't even have an on-set assistant.

404
21:47.680 --> 21:49.080
Heatstroke put him in the hospital.

405
21:50.600 --> 21:52.560
I don't know exactly what happened.

406
21:53.065 --> 21:55.305
Only the two of them know the full story.

407
21:55.640 --> 21:56.880
Good thing he's one of us.

408
21:56.960 --> 21:58.079
No one else saw.

409
22:02.200 --> 22:05.160
One look and I knew. A fellow Niangzi shipper.

410
22:05.240 --> 22:09.519
What a night. Full of ups and downs downs downs.

411
22:16.720 --> 22:17.720
Leave it to me.

412
22:20.759 --> 22:21.799
About what happened...

413
22:22.680 --> 22:24.160
could you keep it between us?

414
22:25.920 --> 22:26.920
Any photos?

415
22:31.440 --> 22:32.920
Could you delete them?

416
22:36.359 --> 22:38.599
I don't want anyone seeing him like this.

417
22:38.799 --> 22:41.640
Gu Yiliang, you're making it sound worse.

418
22:41.665 --> 22:42.979
I'm begging you.

419
22:43.003 --> 22:44.909
Could you say who you're talking about?

420
22:44.933 --> 22:48.372
“I don't want anyone seeing ME like this.”

421
22:53.480 --> 22:54.920
These came out pretty well.

422
22:55.000 --> 22:56.000
You can keep them.

423
22:56.559 --> 22:58.200
Just don't spread them around.

424
22:58.359 --> 22:58.759
Mm.

425
22:59.359 --> 23:01.680
Could you send me the originals?

426
23:09.920 --> 23:10.599
Mingming.

427
23:10.920 --> 23:11.920
What are you doing?

428
23:12.279 --> 23:14.279
It's so hot. I'm drenched in sweat.

429
23:14.559 --> 23:15.680
The AC barely works.

430
23:15.839 --> 23:16.440
I need a shower.

431
23:16.440 --> 23:17.440
Put this on.

432
23:19.079 --> 23:20.079
Your fever just broke.

433
23:20.359 --> 23:21.359
Skip the shower.

434
23:30.599 --> 23:32.359
How long have you been doing this, kid?

435
23:33.960 --> 23:34.960
A few years now.

436
23:35.759 --> 23:36.920
How does it feel, sir?

437
23:37.359 --> 23:38.359
Mm.

438
23:38.480 --> 23:40.160
You've improved since a few years ago.

439
23:40.400 --> 23:41.400
Next time I come in,

440
23:41.480 --> 23:42.480
I'll ask for you.

441
23:50.559 --> 23:51.680
Do you remember?

442
23:52.039 --> 23:53.759
After our first time,

443
23:54.480 --> 23:55.839
you washed my hair, too.

444
23:56.160 --> 23:57.160
I was washing your hair,

445
23:57.559 --> 23:58.599
and you were crying.

446
23:59.160 --> 24:00.720
I thought you regretted it.

447
24:01.599 --> 24:03.680
You kept digging your nails into my scalp.

448
24:03.720 --> 24:04.720
It hurt like hell.

449
24:05.200 --> 24:06.680
I was scared you'd get mad,

450
24:07.000 --> 24:08.079
so I just cried.

451
24:10.519 --> 24:11.519
What about this time?

452
24:12.000 --> 24:13.000
Why didn't you tell me?

453
24:13.880 --> 24:14.880
That you ended up in hospital.

454
24:19.000 --> 24:20.200
I didn't want to bother you.

455
24:21.000 --> 24:22.680
You'd say I wasn't worth the money.

456
24:30.640 --> 24:31.720
I won't say that again.

457
24:32.680 --> 24:35.240
Before, I was afraid the fish would swim away.

458
24:38.480 --> 24:39.279
All right, all right.

459
24:39.359 --> 24:40.359
Just finish washing.

460
24:41.039 --> 24:42.039
It's getting late.

461
24:42.240 --> 24:43.359
Then go straight back.

462
24:45.359 --> 24:46.359
Okay.

463
25:02.240 --> 25:04.480
Life really has its twists and turns.

464
25:05.119 --> 25:07.000
So cheap.

465
25:11.039 --> 25:12.039
Sit down for a minute.

466
25:16.519 --> 25:17.519
I'll be right back.

467
25:23.686 --> 25:25.060
[Hospital invoice]

468
25:25.359 --> 25:26.480
I'm so fragile.

469
25:27.160 --> 25:29.400
This won't mess up tomorrow's big scene, will it?

470
25:51.880 --> 25:54.880
You have a room this old-fashioned?

471
25:55.559 --> 25:58.319
Oh, this was all my grandparents' stuff.

472
25:59.920 --> 26:02.160
They used to teach at a university.

473
26:03.599 --> 26:07.359
I grew up with them in faculty housing.

474
26:08.519 --> 26:11.000
Then, when I was in elementary school,

475
26:11.119 --> 26:12.119
they both passed away.

476
26:21.160 --> 26:22.160
Is this...

477
26:22.400 --> 26:23.880
is this a picture of your mom?

478
26:25.799 --> 26:26.799
Yeah.

479
26:27.319 --> 26:28.559
She looks just like you.

480
26:28.680 --> 26:30.759
The eyes. The nose.

481
26:31.799 --> 26:33.440
My grandma always said that, too.

482
26:34.079 --> 26:35.680
And your mom, is she...?

483
26:35.759 --> 26:36.759
She passed away.

484
26:38.240 --> 26:39.240
Oh.

485
26:41.839 --> 26:43.319
When she was pregnant,

486
26:44.599 --> 26:45.680
she caught Dad cheating.

487
26:48.079 --> 26:50.200
They divorced after she had me.

488
26:51.240 --> 26:52.240
Soon after that,

489
26:54.519 --> 26:55.960
she was diagnosed with cancer.

490
26:56.720 --> 26:57.720
She didn't have long.

491
27:02.799 --> 27:06.240
I read somewhere in a magazine

492
27:06.400 --> 27:10.319
that pregnancy changes your hormone levels

493
27:11.720 --> 27:14.240
and can trigger certain illnesses.

494
27:15.440 --> 27:16.200
Do you think...

495
27:16.279 --> 27:18.319
if she'd found out Dad was cheating

496
27:19.480 --> 27:20.720
and ended the pregnancy then,

497
27:21.799 --> 27:23.359
she wouldn't have gotten sick?

498
27:24.039 --> 27:25.039
Look at her.

499
27:25.119 --> 27:26.279
She was so young.

500
27:29.519 --> 27:31.480
I actually asked my mom the same thing.

501
27:32.039 --> 27:33.039
I asked her,

502
27:33.599 --> 27:35.039
“Being a single mom is so hard.

503
27:35.279 --> 27:36.440
If you hadn't had me,

504
27:36.880 --> 27:38.200
would you have had more options?”

505
27:38.839 --> 27:40.000
What did she say?

506
27:41.079 --> 27:42.200
She gave me an earful.

507
27:42.519 --> 27:43.519
She said,

508
27:45.599 --> 27:48.079
“Who says a mom can't have better options?

509
27:48.319 --> 27:50.279
I'll work for what I want.

510
27:50.640 --> 27:51.960
Sooner or later, I'll get it.”

511
27:53.480 --> 27:55.039
I think what your mom meant was

512
27:55.640 --> 27:56.640
she'll get whatever

513
27:57.279 --> 27:58.279
she sets her heart on.

514
27:59.000 --> 28:00.119
And everything she has

515
28:00.680 --> 28:01.839
is something she chose.

516
28:02.279 --> 28:03.279
Including you.

517
28:04.599 --> 28:05.599
Then I bet

518
28:06.079 --> 28:07.519
your mom felt the same way.

519
28:08.640 --> 28:09.640
Mm.

520
28:11.760 --> 28:17.193
If I could be as brave as my mom right now, could I get what I want, too?

521
28:18.000 --> 28:19.000
Gu Yiliang.

522
28:19.240 --> 28:20.240
I...

523
28:20.880 --> 28:21.880
I...

524
28:23.039 --> 28:24.039
Found it.

525
28:26.400 --> 28:27.839
You're having trouble walking.

526
28:27.920 --> 28:29.000
You need this.

527
28:38.200 --> 28:40.039
Gu. Yi. Liang.

528
28:40.612 --> 28:43.052
The Monkey King's staff!

529
30:29.309 --> 30:31.335
Why? Seriously, why?

530
30:31.719 --> 30:36.492
Whenever I hide in the closet, shipping us, Gu Yiliang drags me right out.

531
30:36.517 --> 30:39.278
Then he flirts till I lose my mind,

532
30:39.279 --> 30:40.559
goes full straight guy again,

533
30:40.640 --> 30:42.393
and shoves me back in by the hair.

534
30:42.417 --> 30:44.831
And now he's dead asleep.

535
30:45.160 --> 30:46.160
Are you asleep?

536
30:47.240 --> 30:48.920
Oh. No.

537
30:49.400 --> 30:50.400
What's up?

538
30:52.480 --> 30:53.759
When I said, “Let's play,”

539
30:54.319 --> 30:55.799
did that upset you?

540
30:56.640 --> 30:57.759
No.

541
30:59.599 --> 31:00.599
Good.

542
31:01.079 --> 31:03.599
I thought you were so fierce in the game

543
31:03.680 --> 31:05.400
because you were mad at me.

544
31:12.400 --> 31:15.519
I'm spent, silent, defeated, hopeless. Post-nut clarity has set in.

545
31:15.599 --> 31:18.920
I'm done reading into anything Gu Yiliang does.

546
31:19.000 --> 31:21.079
Whatever I think he'll do,

547
31:21.160 --> 31:24.913
he slips right past every guess I make.

548
31:27.320 --> 31:28.519
Wait a second.

549
31:28.599 --> 31:31.119
What if I think the opposite?

550
31:34.599 --> 31:38.340
Gu Yiliang definitely won't choke. He definitely won't choke.

551
31:43.279 --> 31:47.079
Holy crap. He always does the opposite of what I predict.

552
31:47.160 --> 31:49.880
I, Wei Yanzi, am an expert in all things Gu.

553
31:51.200 --> 31:53.160
Gu Yiliang is so not gay. Not gay. Not gay.

554
31:53.839 --> 31:54.839
I quit smoking.

555
31:57.599 --> 31:59.960
I used to smoke when I felt down.

556
32:01.119 --> 32:02.599
I don't think I'll need it anymore.

557
32:03.720 --> 32:05.712
In a moment like this, he brings up smoking?

558
32:05.913 --> 32:07.806
This guy is definitely straight.

559
32:08.092 --> 32:10.132
Farewell, my ship.

560
32:16.599 --> 32:20.119
Damn, this reverse-prediction thing really works.

561
32:20.586 --> 32:22.000
This has to be witchcraft.

562
32:22.079 --> 32:25.680
That... doesn't sound very straight.

563
32:26.079 --> 32:27.680
Because I've got someone now

564
32:28.319 --> 32:29.680
who always makes me happy.

565
32:36.359 --> 32:38.799
Welcome back, my sweet ship.
